# Make the AI judge happy — entry

Entry for the make.fun bounty [Make the AI judge happy](https://make.fun/bounty/ai-happy-01)
(`ai-happy-01`).

The program `main.py` (Python 3.13, standard library only) copies the
bundled image `happy.jpg` — a joyful golden retriever puppy in a sunny
wildflower meadow — to the output path as `entry.png`. No network, fully
deterministic: every run writes the same bytes.

## Files

- `main.py` — the entry program
- `happy.jpg` — the image (1024×1024, JPEG, 237 KB)
- `LICENSE` — MIT

## Run

```sh
mkdir -p out && MAKEFUN_OUTPUT_DIR=out python3 main.py
# writes out/entry.png
```
